    "body": "Status check (mkinney pool, work job; no claim, no branch, no PR): PR #3259 (merged as `f2c443540`, `Refs #3252`) already fixed the defect. STEP healing no longer removes the explicit short edge and enlarges the endpoint gap.\n\nOne item stays open, and it is a maintainer decision: when the source itself has a gap above the 0.001 mm limit, show a reduced-fidelity view, or keep the current refusal? The issue asks this question, and nobody has answered it yet. We did not change code.",
